<div class="app-header"><div><h1>CabinetDrafter <span class="muted">1.1.1</span></h1><p class="muted"><strong>Free cabinet design, material planning, nesting, and 3D.</strong> Plan frameless or face-frame cabinets in the browser, with optional SketchUp export.</p></div><button type="button" id="openHelp" class="help-button">Help</button></div>

